	;TODO: this implementation is jank and it really needs to be changed to use one of the game's functions, but I'm leaving that for someone else
	PRINTFORMDL You 
	PRINTDL [0] decide to wait for Nazrin while giving her a little space...
	PRINTDL [1] let her be and go back to the temple by yourself.
	;告白を断ったフラグが立っていなければ告白し返すアタックチャンス
	SIF CFLAG:1202 != 3
		PRINTDL [2] apologize for making Nazrin confess before you could confess to her yourself. 
