		PRINTFORML （That fact that %HE_SHE(MASTER)% even waited for me like this shows that %HE_SHE(MASTER)% at least sees me as someone %HE_SHE(MASTER)% should be nice to.）
		PRINTFORMW （...Just knowing that much is enough for me...）
