			PRINTFORML 「As punishment, why don't you just sit right here while I get in a little nap～」
			PRINTFORMDW Without waiting for your response, Nazrin pulls you down and curls up beside you, using your shoulder for a pillow.
		ELSEIF TALENT:恋人 || TALENT:恋慕
			SELECTCASE RAND:8
				CASE 0
					PRINTFORMW 「This made me happy. I'm not kidding, it really did.」
					PRINTFORML 「With my special ability, it's easy for me to go find enjoyable things.」
					PRINTFORMW 「But this happiness, you're the only one who can give it to me.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Without you, no matter how powerful my abilities are, I'd never be able to find happiness like this.」
				CASE 1
					PRINTFORMW 「Well then, see you next time. I'm really looking forward to doing this again.」
				CASE 2
					PRINTFORMW 「If you need anything, I'll be in my room. Feel free to stop by whenever.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Whatever you want, whether it's casual conversation, or ～sexual relief～... I'm your mouse.」
				CASE 3
					PRINTFORML 「Hey, mind if I do it just one more time?」
					PRINTFORMDW Nazrin rubs her nose against your stomach before turning to walk away.
				CASE 4
					PRINTFORML 「Thanks for such a perfect date.」
					PRINTFORMW 「I feel like I love you just that bit more than I did yesterday～」
				CASE 5
					PRINTFORML 「Hey, mind if I do it just one more time?」
					PRINTFORMW Nazrin pulls you down and gives you a quick smooch on the cheek before turning to walk away.
				CASE 6
					PRINTFORML 「As far as I'm concerned, I'd be fine with staying with you forever.」
					PRINTFORMW 「But I know that even someone like you needs %HIS_HER(MASTER)% private time, so there's no helping it, I guess......」
				CASE 7
					PRINTFORMW 「The time really flew by. I wish we could stay together longer...」
			ENDSELECT
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕 || TALENT:セフレ || TALENT:愛欲
			PRINTFORMW 「That was pretty fun. Thanks for the date, it wasn't half bad.」
		ELSEIF EXP:キス経験 > 0
			PRINTFORMW 「It's a shame we have to call it quits, but let's part ways here. See you later.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「I'd like to do something like that again. Let's keep it in mind for the next time we happen to cross paths.」
		ENDIF
